# ACN-Data mapping

- Session columns come from ACN-Data (see [docs/DATASET.md](docs/DATASET.md)). Do not invent Parquet schemas or extra session fields.
- Caltech / JPL / office001 are **sites**. Each site has many `stationID` / `spaceID` EVSEs. Do not treat EVSEs as geographically independent city stations.
- Demand ML aggregates real Caltech sessions (site-level 15-minute energy first).
- Simulator stations are synthetic and calibrated from ACN arrival / energy / duration stats. Vehicle telemetry is synthetic.
- MVP ingest site is `caltech` only. JPL and office001 are later robustness splits.
- Use `DataClient.get_sessions_by_time`, not ACN-Sim `generate_events`, for data prep.
